+
+**Execution:**
+- `WorkOrderQualityRatingService.java` -- submit/get/expire-on-read -- core use cases
+- `WorkOrderDtos.java` -- add records -- API contract
+- `WorkOrderController.java` -- add endpoints -- expose the service
